# LF for every payload on this branch.
#
# The pipeline writes JSON from a Linux runner and the frontend reads it over
# the CDN, so endings would normally never matter. They matter here because a
# developer on Windows may clone this branch to inspect a payload, and a
# round trip through a CRLF working tree would rewrite every file in the next
# commit, producing a diff of thousands of lines with no content change.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
